uve de l'autre coté de la rivière.","en":"The castle is across the river.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"castle (fortified…"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"other"},null,null,null,{"g":"a river"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"of the"]]},{"text":"On peut patiner de ce coté du lac en toute sécurité.","en":"It is safe to skate on this lake.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to ice-skate"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this / it"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"lake"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"security, safety"}]},{"text":"Tom ne voulait pas s'asseoir à coté de moi.","en":"Tom didn't want to sit next to me.","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to sit down"},{"g":"to / at"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Bien qu'il habite la porte d'à coté, il ne nous dit même pas bonjour.","en":"Even though he lives next door, he doesn't even say hello to us.","words":[{"g":"well"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to live in, to occupy","l":"habiter"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to / at"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},null,null,{"g":"greetings"}],"phrases":[[13,15,"no, not even!"]]}]}